<title>GERMANY: Heidelberger sets one for 10 rights issue.</title>
<headline>Heidelberger sets one for 10 rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>HEIDELBERG, Germany 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bonus shares</p>
<p>Nominal share value 50 marks unless otherwise stated</p>
<p>Terms : One new share for 10 already held.</p>
<p>New shares entitled to dividend as of January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Nominal capital to 242 million from 220 million</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Heidelberger Zement AG</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 7565 1246</p>
</text>
